# The activated Gingerbrutes refuse blockers without haste (CR 509.1b): Fanatical Firebrand, which has haste as blockers are
# declared, may block one, and Llanowar Elves only the unactivated third. The restriction ends with the turn (CR 514.2): on
# its next attack Ornithopter blocks Gingerbrute.

[Bot1 Deck]
Gingerbrute x3
Island
