[T3 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Gingerbrute#1.BlockRestriction = Can't be blocked except by creatures with haste
? Bot1.Battlefield.Gingerbrute#2.BlockRestriction = Can't be blocked except by creatures with haste
